WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
A young seedling in a cracked terracotta pot on a greenhouse workbench.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
An adult caretaker's hand touches the dry soil beside the seedling.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
A watering-can spout pours water into the seedling's pot.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The same seedling and pot on the workbench in warm evening light.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The same greenhouse workbench and pot under cool night lighting.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The caretaker returns to water the same potted plant in daylight.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000
A hand steadies the familiar pot beside a fuller, upright plant.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
A wide view returns to the workbench. The plant now stands upright with several healthy leaves; the caretaker’s hand rests beside it.

